www.google.com/about/careers/applications/jobs/results?company=DeepMind&amp;utm_source=deepmind&amp;utm_medium=jobposting" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"> <div class="button__label">View open roles</div> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="jumplinks--placeholder"></div><div class="glue-jumplinks js-jumplinks jumplinks"><div class="jumplinks__button-wrapper"><button aria-label="Previous" class="glue-jumplinks__button glue-jumplinks__button--prev"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md-outlined" data-icon="chevron_left"></span></button></div><ul class="glue-jumplinks__list" data-glue-jumplink-label="Jump to section within page"><li class="glue-jumplinks__list-item"><a class="glue-jumplinks__link jumplinks__button" data-event-content-name="Work at the frontier of AI" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#work-at-the-frontier-of-ai"> Work at the frontier of AI </a></li><li class="glue-jumplinks__list-item"><a class="glue-jumplinks__link jumplinks__button" data-event-content-name="Roles" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#roles"> Roles </a></li><li class="glue-jumplinks__list-item"><a class="glue-jumplinks__link jumplinks__button" data-event-content-name="Locations" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#locations"> Locations </a></li><li class="glue-jumplinks__list-item"><a class="glue-jumplinks__link jumplinks__button" data-event-content-name="Interview process" data-event-content-type="jumplinks" data-gtm-event="in_page_navigation" href="#interview-process"> Interview process </a></li></ul><div class="jumplinks__button-wrapper"><button aria-label="Next" class="glue-jumplinks__button glue-jumplinks__button--next"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md-outlined" data-icon="chevron_right"></span></button></div></div><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top section--only-jumplinks" id="jump-links"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id="work-at-the-frontier-of-ai"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-6-lg grid__column--offset-3-lg grid__column--span-8-md grid__column--offset-2-md grid__column--span-12-sm grid__column--span-12-xs"><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="8xlre"><span class="text-center"><span class="text-left">Work at the frontier of AI</span></span></h2><p data-block-key="e7fo7">Weâ\x80\x99re searching for people who share our drive to build the next generation of breakthrough AI systems, safely and responsibly.</p><p data-block-key="56p4r">Accelerate science, drive transformation across entire industries â\x80\x93Â\xa0and develop AI products with the potential to improve lives around the globe.</p><p data-block-key="e33sr">Help create the technology that will shape the world. Join us â\x80\x93 and do the best work of your career.</p></div><div class="spacer-block-md-bottom"></div><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="8xlre"><span class="text-center"><span class="text-left">Use AI to solve humanityâ\x80\x99s biggest challenges</span></span></h2><p data-block-key="bbike">Your work could positively impact billions of lives.</p><p data-block-key="75jta">So far, our AI models have helped scientists understand how lifeâ\x80\x99s molecules interact. Advanced research into treatments for deadly diseases, like malaria. Discovered new candidate materials for batteries and solar cells. And even helped us generate more accurate weather forecasts â\x80\x93 crucial in a world of increasing extremes.</p><p data-block-key="bc7nt">Help us discover what comes next.</p></div><div class="spacer-block-md-bottom"></div><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="8xlre"><span class="text-center"><span class="text-left">Work on state-of-the-art models</span></span></h2><p data-block-key="ei8ui">Help unlock a new era of intelligence.</p><p data-block-key="b61tm">Create state-of-the-art generative AI models with global reach â\x80\x93 and work on landmark products like Gemini, Veo, and Gemini\'s image generator â\x80\x9cNano Bananaâ\x80\x9d. Stay at the forefront of AI development, and invent entirely new product experiences.</p><p data-block-key="fmumr">Work with us towards our goal of making AI useful for everyone.</p></div><div class="spacer-block-md-bottom"></div><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="8xlre"><span class="text-center"><span class="text-left">Collaborate with leading talent</span></span></h2><p data-block-key="2ju8m">To develop extraordinary technology, we rely on an extraordinary team.</p><p data-block-key="cnbu8">Work alongside best-in-class engineers, leading ethicists â\x80\x93 and even Nobel Prize-winning scientists. Team up with leading partners building nuclear fusion reactors,Â\xa0gravitational wave detectors, genome databases â\x80\x93 and more. All with the support of leaders who have dedicated their careers to pioneering AI research.</p><p data-block-key="1fn89">Find endless opportunities to learn, and develop your skills as a leading mind among leading minds.</p></div><div class="spacer-block-md-bottom"></div><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="db081">Create breakthrough AI for global impact</h2><p data-block-key="11frq">Weâ\x80\x99re the engine room for pioneering AI innovation at Google.</p><p data-block-key="946c5">Our groundbreaking research underpins our cutting-edge models, which are trained on Googleâ\x80\x99s state-of-the-art infrastructure â\x80\x93Â\xa0which, in turn, is built on chips that we design. And our models are deployed via the same global infrastructure, to rapidly reach billions of users.</p><p data-block-key="9pqec">Our unique full-stack approach allows us to push further in every aspect of our work. Step in, and help us shape the next wave of transformation.</p></div></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id="quote"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-8-md grid__column--offset-2-md grid__column--span-12-sm grid__column--span-12-xs"><quote-ambient> <figure class="quote quote--ambient quote--full quote--text-size-large quote--text-auto spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="quote__ambient-inner"><div class="quote__background"><div class="quote__background-solid"></div></div><div class="quote__content"><blockquote class="quote__text"><p data-block-key="a261g">We have a real opportunity to deliver AI research and products that dramatically improve the lives of billions of people, transform industries and advance science.</p></blockquote><div class="quote__attribution"><figcaption class="quote__author"><span class="quote__author-details"> <div class="quote__author-name">Demis Hassabis</div> <div class="quote__author-subtitle">CEO, Google DeepMind</div> </span></figcaption></div></div></div></figure> </quote-ambient></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top section--has-background section--grey" id="roles"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class="grid__column--span-12"><div class="section-header section-header--medium section-header--stacked section-header--no-paragraphs section-header--paragraphs-left section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class="section-header__heading"><h2 class="section-header__title">Roles</h2></div></div></div><div class="accordion"><div class="container"><div class="accordion__inner"><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-1" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Research Engineer</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-1" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Research Engineers are software engineers with a deep understanding of machine learning and deep learning, bringing a combination of engineering, mathematical, and research skills to advance GDMâ\x80\x99s mission. They are experimentalists, acting as critical bridge between theory and implementationÂ\xa0â\x80\x93Â\xa0designing, building, and scaling complex systems to test and evaluate new ideas. That often leads to co-authorship on leading research papers.</p><p data-block-key="9nan6">Key responsibilities include implementing and optimizing frontier models. Building robust infrastructure for distributed computing. And applying expertise across specialized domains, like Gemini or robotics.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-2" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Software Engineer</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-2" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Researchers focus on what AI can do. Software engineers make it happen, by scoping, developing, maintaining, and upgrading our software. Their passion for machine learning helps them turn technical solutions into engineering challenges. They define software roadmaps and architecture â\x80\x93 and solve long-term problems from end to end.</p><p data-block-key="5ns45">Software engineers understand the research environment and use it to inform engineering focus.Key responsibilities include developing reliable and efficient software, built for scale. And sharing deep software engineering expertise across the business.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-3" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Product Manager</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-3" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Product Managers set out roadmaps for our AI products, and drive them from concept to implementation â\x80\x93 in Google and Google DeepMind applications. They support cross-functional teams of researchers and engineers to launch AI models and platforms that meet user needs. And they translate complex AI technical capabilities into actionable product specifications.</p><p data-block-key="dnbsj">Key responsibilities include planning and guiding product development through to deployment, alongside balancing business success with societal responsibilities.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-4" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Program Manager</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-4" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Our large-scale, strategic, cross-functional initiatives rely on Program Managers. This group is responsible for end-to-end program design, managing complex dependencies and handling risks. They also make sure we maintain operational excellence, while meeting (or exceeding) our strategic goals.</p><p data-block-key="aetmi">Key responsibilities include translating strategic ambitions into clear objectives and actionable plans. While aligning stakeholders and communication across the organization.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-5" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Technical Program Manager</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-5" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Technical Program Managers are embedded within specific research and engineering units. They use deep technical understanding to manage programsâ\x80\x99 entire lifecycles â\x80\x93 from early research to production launch and beyond. That means co-developing program strategies, influencing key engineering decisions, and accelerating breakthroughs.</p><p data-block-key="bu0eb">Key responsibilities include performing technical due-diligence. Evaluating complex and technical proposals. And translating complex concepts for diverse audiences across the organization.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-6" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Research Scientist</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-6" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Research Scientists are creative and collaborative, bringing scientific expertise to advance GDMâ\x80\x99s mission. They hold deep theoretical knowledge and an interdisciplinary mindset. Think of them the engine of innovation as we work towards our mission to â\x80\x9csolve intelligenceâ\x80\x9d.</p><p data-block-key="b9kfq">Driven to push the boundaries of AI, they formulate novel hypotheses and algorithmic paradigms that spark world-changing breakthroughs. They normally hold a PhD, may plan and execute both large- and small-scale research projects, and frequently contribute to foundational research papers.</p><p data-block-key="dblra">Key responsibilities include identifying core research questions, designing and evaluating novel models, and pioneering new approaches in specialized domains like Gemini.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-7" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Operations</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-7" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Our Operations team are multi-disciplinary experts, with a focus on creating and maintaining world-class spaces, infrastructure, and systems â\x80\x93 so that our groundbreaking research, programs, and product development can happen.</p><p data-block-key="ehd0n">Key responsibilities include leading our internal and external engagement strategies, hiring the worldâ\x80\x99s brightest minds, and fostering a collaborative culture.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item accordion__item--medium"><button aria-controls="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-8" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion__header" type="button"><span class="accordion__title accordion__title--medium">Responsibility</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon icon-md-outlined">  </span></button><div aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__content" id="accordion-9557d941-4fbf-4e46-8bea-3787514d58d4-8" inert=""><div class="accordion__content-wrapper"><div class="accordion__content-inner accordion__content-inner--small"><div><div class="accordion__body rich-text"><p data-block-key="p4mcg">Our Responsibility team makes sure we build AI models boldly â\x80\x93 yet thoughtfully. They partner with internal teams, and the wider AI community, to embed ethics into our work and rigorously test our systems. They also address the societal impacts of our technology to guide our path forward.</p><p data-block-key="1lt9i">The team consists of experts from areas including CBRN, assurance evaluations, and AI governance. Key responsibilities span policy, research, and engineering â\x80\x93 giving us insight from many angles, to help us remain responsible.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-md-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id="locations"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-12"><div class="heading-container heading-2 font-weight-450 spacer-block-none-bottom"><p data-block-key="j8znk"><span class="text-center">London</span></p><p data-block-key="e369r"><span class="text-center">Bay Area</span></p><p data-block-key="fndpq"><span class="text-center">Bangalore</span></p><p data-block-key="dcnsr"><span class="text-center">Cambridge (US)</span></p><p data-block-key="2mniq"><span class="text-center">Montreal</span></p><p data-block-key="u629"><span class="text-center">New York City</span></p><p data-block-key="a4bn1"><span class="text-center">Paris</span></p><p data-block-key="ermd2"><span class="text-center">Tokyo</span></p><p data-block-key="ffabv"><span class="text-center">Toronto</span></p><p data-block-key="fhgc5"><span class="text-center">Zurich</span></p></div></div></section><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-lg-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id="location"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-6-lg grid__column--offset-3-lg grid__column--span-8-md grid__column--offset-2-md grid__column--span-12-sm grid__column--span-12-xs"><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="8xlre">Locations</h2><p data-block-key="1nlmm">Weâ\x80\x99re looking for people from all backgrounds, across the world, who want to collaborate to build AI responsibly. Together, weâ\x80\x99ll work to benefit humanity and make a real, positive impact. Our intentional location strategy is designed to create the right environments in the right locations to deliver that impact.</p></div></div></section><hr class="divider"/><section class="section--carousel section-default spacer-block-md-bottom section-padding-top" id="interview-process"><div class="section-container"><div class="section-header section-header--medium section-header--stacked section-header--paragraphs-right section-header--paragraphs-short"><div class="section-header__heading"><h2 class="section-header__title">Our interview process</h2><p class="section-header__subtitle">Weâ\x80\x99ve created a process that\'s as rigorous, fair, and transparent as possible. That way, we can both be sure Google DeepMind is the right next step for your career.</p></div><div class="section-header__paragraph section-header__paragraph--1-of-1"><p data-block-key="yeraa">To help you know what to expect, weâ\x80\x99ve mapped out a typical overview of our interview stages. The exact steps are slightly different for every role. So if you\'re invited to interview we\'ll send you detailed, role-specific information to help you prepare at every stage.</p><div class="section-header__ctas button-group__buttons"><div class="button-group button-group--row"><div class="button-group__buttons"><a class="button button--tonal icon-right" data-event-content-name="View interview guide" data-event-content-type="outbound" data-gtm-event="select_content" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/deepmind-media/DeepMind.com/Assets/Docs/interviewing-at-google-deepmind.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"> <div class="button__icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md-outlined" data-icon="keyboard_arrow_right"></span></div> <div class="button__label">View interview guide</div> </a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-card_carousel"><section aria-label="Our interview process" aria-roledescription="carousel" class="carousel-block carousel js-carousel spacer-block-none-bottom carousel--group-3" data-event-module-name="Our interview process" id="carousel-409dd847-a06a-4b32-96b1-60fbcf7f11f3" role="region"><div aria-atomic="true" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only" id="carousel-announcer-carousel-409dd847-a06a-4b32-96b1-60fbcf7f11f3">Slide 1 of 4</div><div class="embla"><div class="embla__container"><div class="block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class="card__inner"><div class="media-content-wrapper"><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline media-icon--gemini-gradient"><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-16-9"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="block-text"><span class="media-icon__text heading-6">1</span></div></div></div></div></div></figure></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class="card__title">Initial interviews</h3><div class="card__text"><p data-block-key="jaipt">A 30-minute introductory call with your Recruiter, to cover your background and experiences. Theyâ\x80\x99ll tell you more about the role, and learn more about why you applied. Youâ\x80\x99ll have the chance to ask questions, then the Recruiter will outline the next stages of the process.</p><p data-block-key="5f2i0">At this stage, we may also ask you to join an interview with the hiring manager for the role. Theyâ\x80\x99ll ask more questions about specific capabilities, and help you build a better understanding of what their team does.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class="card__inner"><div class="media-content-wrapper"><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline media-icon--gemini-gradient"><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-16-9"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="block-text"><span class="media-icon__text heading-6">2</span></div></div></div></div></div></figure></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class="card__title">Skills interviews</h3><div class="card__text"><p data-block-key="jaipt">Over two or three further calls, weâ\x80\x99ll evaluate you against the competencies and skills required for success in the position. Weâ\x80\x99ll make sure you have a good understanding of what to expect and how to prepare.</p><p data-block-key="70vdn">Youâ\x80\x99ll meet potential peers during these conversations, and be able to ask more questions about working life at Google DeepMind.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class="card__inner"><div class="media-content-wrapper"><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline media-icon--gemini-gradient"><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-16-9"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="block-text"><span class="media-icon__text heading-6">3</span></div></div></div></div></div></figure></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class="card__title">Final interviews</h3><div class="card__text"><p data-block-key="jaipt">During the final round, youâ\x80\x99ll meet Team Leads and leadership â\x80\x93 including your potential manager. Weâ\x80\x99ll still focus on core skills, but through the lens of team goals, future plans, and our culture, mission, and values.</p><p data-block-key="2gi2t">Think of it as a mutual assessment. Weâ\x80\x99ll give you plenty of time to ask questions, so you can be confident weâ\x80\x99re the right fit for you.</p></div></div></div></article></div><div class="block-card"><article class="card card--general"><div class="card__inner"><div class="media-content-wrapper"><figure class="media__container no-light-mode-mobile no-dark-mode no-dark-mode-mobile has-default-media spacer-block-none-bottom"><div class="block-contained"><div class="media-icon media-icon--contained js-media-icon media-icon--contained--outline media-icon--gemini-gradient"><div class="media-icon--contained__inner media--aspect-16-9"><div class="media-icon__icon-wrapper media-icon--contained__icon"><div class="block-text"><span class="media-icon__text heading-6">4</span></div></div></div></div></div></figure></div><div class="card__content card__content--medium card__content--text-hierarchy-scaled card__content--text-size-small"><h3 class="card__title">Decision and offer</h3><div class="card__text"><p data-block-key="jaipt">The hiring team will review your application against our criteria. If youâ\x80\x99re the best candidate for the role, your Recruiter will share the exciting news and talk you through our competitive compensation and benefits package.</p><p data-block-key="6ip3e">Theyâ\x80\x99ll then formally invite you to join Google DeepMind.</p></div></div></div></article></div></div></div><div class="carousel__pagination"><div><div class="combo-button-group"><button aria-controls="carousel-409dd847-a06a-4b32-96b1-60fbcf7f11f3" aria-label="Previous" class="js-carousel__button--prev"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md-fill">  </span></button><button aria-controls="carousel-409dd847-a06a-4b32-96b1-60fbcf7f11f3" aria-label="Next" class="js-carousel__button--next"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md-fill">  </span></button></div></div></div></section></div></div></section><hr class="divider"/><section class="grid section-default spacer-block-sm-bottom spacer-block-md-top" id="we-value-all-perspectives-and-experiences"><div class="grid__inner grid__column--span-6-lg grid__column--offset-3-lg grid__column--span-8-md grid__column--offset-2-md grid__column--span-12-sm grid__column--span-12-xs"><div class="rich-text"><h2 data-block-key="n6vv3">We value all perspectives and experiences</h2><p data-block-key="djrsi">Our team members hold all sorts of experience, knowledge, and backgrounds. Their diversity is invaluable â\x80\x93 and all their unique qualities and perspectives help us create extraordinary impact.</p><p data-block-key="4mpur">If you have a disability, need assistive technology, or other extra support during the interview process, please let us know. Weâ\x80\x99re happy to help. The information you share will only be used to make the process more accessible for you, in line with our <a href="https://careers.google.com/privacy-policy/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy</a>.</p><p data-block-key="55gov">Google is proud to be an equal opportunity and affirmative action employer. We are committed to building a workforce that is representative of the users we serve, creating a culture of belonging, and providing an equal employment opportunity regardless of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), expecting or parents-to-be, criminal histories consistent with legal requirements, or any other basis protected by law.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-cover spacer-none-bottom" id="student-researcher-program"><div class="section-cover--full-page section-cover--scrim-none section-cover--text-color-auto"><div class="section-default cover grid cover--headline-size-large cover--eyebrow-size-medium"><div class="cover__content grid__column--span-8-md grid__column--offset-2-md grid__column--span-12-sm grid__column--span-12-xs"><div class="cover__text"><span class="cover__text--eyebrow spacer-md-bottom">Student Researcher Program</span><h2 class="cover__text--title">Hands-on collaboration with leading minds in AI</h2></div><div class="cover__buttons spacer-2xl-top"><div class="button-group button-group--stacked"><div class="button-group__buttons"><a class="button button--outlined icon-none" data-event-content-name="Hands-on collaboration with leading minds in AI - Learn more" data-event-content-type="internal" data-gtm-event="select_content" href="/student-researcher-program/"> <div class="button__label">Learn more</div> </a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
