e petition</a>\xa0as a “a step backward” and “the worst kind of protectionism.” The three groups recently joined SEIA and others as members of ETAC.</p></blockquote>\n<p><section class="publication-slider alignfull" id="block-f53cbe4628a8f68cd42badf58746a580">\n<div class="container">\n<div class="publication-slider__heading-row">\n<h2 class="publication-slider__subtitle kicker">Featured Publications</h2>\n</div>\n<div class="publication-slider__wrap wow animate__animated animate__fadeInRight">\n<div class="publication-slider__grid grid 1">\n<article class="grid-post column">\n<div class="grid-post__thumb-wrap"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/commentary/the-maine-crisis-separating-selection-from-election/"><img alt="" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" decoding="async" height="458" loading="lazy" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" src="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-1024x732.jpeg" srcset="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-1024x732.jpeg 1024w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-300x214.jpeg 300w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-768x549.jpeg 768w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-1536x1097.jpeg 1536w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-2048x1463.jpeg 2048w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/AdobeStock_340508730-scaled-1-1512x1080.jpeg 1512w" width="640"/></a></div> <div class="grid-post__content">\n<div class="grid-post__top-meta">\n<span class="grid-post__types">Analysis</span> <span class="grid-post__areas"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/issues/electoral-reform/">Electoral Reform</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/governance/">Governance</a></span> </div>\n<h3 class="grid-post__title medium-headline"><a href="https://www.